DESCRIPTION

  mimalloc is a general purpose allocator with excellent performance
  characteristics developed by Microsoft Research.

  It features:
  - Small footprint with no dependencies
  - Free list sharding for good multi-threaded performance
  - Secure mode with randomised allocation, guard pages, etc.
  - First-class support for heaps and heap walking

ORIGIN

  https://github.com/microsoft/mimalloc
  Version 3.2.7
  Retrieved 2024-01-24

