LOCAL MODIFICATIONS

  - Created cosmo_config.h for Cosmopolitan-specific configuration
  - Created cosmo_prim.c implementing platform primitives using Cosmopolitan APIs
  - Modified BUILD.mk for integration with Cosmopolitan build system
  - Disabled automatic malloc/free override (MI_MALLOC_OVERRIDE=0)
  - Disabled transparent huge pages for cross-platform compatibility
  - Custom process init/done using Cosmopolitan constructor priorities

INTEGRATION NOTES

  mimalloc is integrated as an optional allocator alongside dlmalloc.
  Selection is controlled at compile time via COSMO_USE_MIMALLOC or
  COSMO_USE_DLMALLOC defines.

  Default allocator selection by build mode:
  - MODE= (default): mimalloc
  - MODE=dbg: mimalloc with MI_DEBUG=2, MI_SECURE=4
  - MODE=opt: mimalloc
  - MODE=rel: mimalloc
  - MODE=tiny: dlmalloc (smaller binary size)
  - MODE=tinylinux: dlmalloc
  - MODE=aarch64-tiny: dlmalloc
